manifest.json records the release archives and their SHA-256 digests, each
read from the release's own archive. These are checksums of compressed
archives, not of extracted binaries. No executable is bundled and this pin
alone does not install or run agy.

1.4.12 is the first agy this pin holds that serves the Agent Client Protocol:
`agy acp`, which 1.4.4 does not have.
